    skos:prefLabel "4 Transitional—items 1, 2 and 3 of Schedule 3"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4-2 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by items 1, 2 and 3 of Schedule 3 apply to any sentence imposed after the commencement of those items,    Crimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other Measures) whether or not the offence concerned was committed before that commencement.  Schedule 1  People smuggling" ;
