concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Crimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "slavery has the same meaning as in Division 270. threat means:  (a) a threat of force; or  (b) a threat to cause a person’s deportation; or  (c) a threat of any other detrimental action unless there are reasonable grounds for the threat of that action in connection with the provision of labour or services by a person." ;
    skos:definition "slavery has the same meaning as in Division 270. threat means:  (a) a threat of force; or  (b) a threat to cause a person’s deportation; or  (c) a threat of any other detrimental action unless there are reasonable grounds for the threat of that action in connection with the provision of labour or services by a person."@en ;
