concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73 6  Meaning of travel or identity document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a document is a travel or identity document if it is:  (a) a travel document; or  (b) an identity document.  (2) In subsection (1): identity document includes any kind of document that may be used to establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or procedures of that country. travel document includes any kind of document required, under the law of a country, to enter or leave that country.  Schedule 1  People smuggling" ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Subdivision, a document is a travel or identity document if it is:  (a) a travel document; or  (b) an identity document.  (2) In subsection (1): identity document includes any kind of document that may be used to establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or procedures of that country. travel document includes any kind of document required, under the law of a country, to enter or leave that country.  Schedule 1  People smuggling"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2253fc42494a34bf4101a963519f149224b8928b68d89386392346d4fa747174" ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-2 ;
