concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(2) 6  Meaning of travel or identity document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-6-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In subsection (1): identity document includes any kind of document that may be used to establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or procedures of that country. travel document includes any kind of document required, under the law of a country, to enter or leave that country.  Schedule 1  People smuggling" ;
    skos:definition "(2) In subsection (1): identity document includes any kind of document that may be used to establish the identity of a person in a country under the law or procedures of that country. travel document includes any kind of document required, under the law of a country, to enter or leave that country.  Schedule 1  People smuggling"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3cfc21b959cd2dd10f9025b06846a89516072030d72df181644fcbf666f672d5" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-73-6 ;
