concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Crimes Legislation Amendment (People Smuggling, Firearms Trafficking and Other"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.  (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a threat may be:  (a) express or implied; or  (b) conditional or unconditional.  (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), dishonest means:  (a) dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people; and  (b) known by the defendant to be dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people.  (4) In a prosecution for an offence against this section, the determination of dishonesty is a matter for the trier of fact." ;
    skos:definition "Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.  (2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a threat may be:  (a) express or implied; or  (b) conditional or unconditional.  (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), dishonest means:  (a) dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people; and  (b) known by the defendant to be dishonest according to the standards of ordinary people.  (4) In a prosecution for an offence against this section, the determination of dishonesty is a matter for the trier of fact."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6dfb551e39a00464c6d968318a74ce967876fede876649d85930dbdecf12e573" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-10-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2004a01078-sch-1-sec-10-ss-4 ;
