concept:c2004a01078-sch-3-sec-13 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13 The Schedule (paragraphs 148.1(2)(a) and (b) of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-13 ;
    values:originalText "Criminal Code) Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) the person falsely represents himself or herself to be a Commonwealth public official in a particular capacity; and  (b) the person does so in the course of doing an act, or attending a place, in the assumed capacity of such an official." ;
    skos:definition "Criminal Code) Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) the person falsely represents himself or herself to be a Commonwealth public official in a particular capacity; and  (b) the person does so in the course of doing an act, or attending a place, in the assumed capacity of such an official."@en ;
