    skos:prefLabel "14 The Schedule (subsection 148.1(2A) of the Criminal Code)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (2A) For the purposes of subsection (2), it is immaterial whether that capacity as a Commonwealth public official exists or is fictitious." ;
